			"text": "## dog-cross-start\nimage\nstatus: done\nmodel: krea-2\nsize: 1232x928\nseed: 74\nprompt: \"A realistic photograph of a German Shepherd guard dog in a full side view facing right, small in the frame: the whole dog from nose to tail tip is visible, standing near the left side of the frame with a little green space behind its tail, the dog is about one fifth of the frame width, its paws near the bottom of the frame, the rest of the frame to the right is empty. Flat, evenly lit pure green screen background, no floor, no shadow.\"\n",
